{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 40, :comments ["<b>And the Canaanite, king of Arad, heard.</b> Scripture juxtaposed the section of 'and the Canaanite heard' to the death of Aaron. This is what they expounded in the Midrash — what report did he hear? He heard that Aaron had died and the clouds of glory had withdrawn, and once they had withdrawn, he thought that permission had been granted to wage war against them."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:37:44.349841581Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}